	<section_number>22.1-137</section_number>
	<catch_line>Fire drills</catch_line>
	<text>
		Every public school shall hold fire drills during the school session in accordance with the requirements of the Statewide Fire Prevention Code (§ 27-94 et seq.).
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 22-156; 1971, Ex. Sess., c. 163; 1980, c. 559; 1993, c. 212; 2016, c. 524; 2024, c. 432.</history>
